 "10127": {
  "en": [
   "There by the window she sits, her head resting on her palm—",
   "flowers lie fallen in her lap; she has forgotten to string the garland.",
   "Only the breeze goes murmuring by, whispering who knows what in her ear—",
   "so half reclining, half sitting, she muses on so many things.",
   "Before her eyes the clouds drift past, the birds fly on and on—",
   "all day long the bakul flowers keep dropping, now and again.",
   "Sweet languor, sweet rapture, the sweet smile on her face—",
   "in a sweet dream, within her heart, the sweet flute is playing."
  ],
