 "10147": {
  "en": [
   "Today Shyam will come back to Gokul.",
   "Again the flute will sound on the Yamuna's bank.",
   "What shall we do? What dress shall we wear?",
   "What garland shall we put on? Shall we live, or die of joy?",
   "What shall we say to him? Will words stay on our lips?",
   "Only gazing and gazing at his face,",
   "we shall stand and be flooded with our tears."
