 "10148": {
  "en": [
   "King of kings, on your brow the garland of victory—",
   "Tripura's own Lakshmi bears your tray of welcome.",
   "Your word of courage ferries the weak past fear; your hand is skilled at lifting the sorrows of the poor;",
   "the young moon of your face is brimming with mercy.",
   "At your generous door, thronged by the gifted and discerning, blessing presides with manifold offerings—",
   "with the dawn-rays of your virtues all the world is alight."
