 "10150": {
  "en": [
   "The naked goddess dances in the ecstasy of battle; we dance along with her.",
   "Darkening the ten directions, the sky-clad one runs wild;",
   "her red tongue blazes like a flame of fire—",
   "seeing it, the moths rush in to die.",
   "Her black hair flew across the sky,",
   "sun and moon hid in terror.",
   "Red streams of blood run down her black body—",
   "the three worlds tremble at the arch of her brow."
